# Inventory با PowerShell

```powershell
Invoke-Command -ComputerName (Get-Content hosts.txt) -ScriptBlock {
  [pscustomobject]@{
    Host = $env:COMPUTERNAME
    IP = (Get-NetIPAddress -AddressFamily IPv4 | ? {$_.IPAddress -notlike '127*'}).IPAddress
    GW = (Get-NetRoute -DestinationPrefix '0.0.0.0/0').NextHop
  }
}
```

خروجی را CSV کن برای CMDB سبک
